{
  "description": "Move 4 — one byte formatter. The canonical SI form (byte-identical to quota::format_storage_si), the binary/IEC form, and the explicit-decimals compact form used by dense tables; boundaries at 1000/1024, 1 MiB/GiB/TiB, the TB decimal, negatives and i64::MAX.",
  "source": "core beebeeb-types/src/quota.rs format_storage_si (frozen bytes, moved to beebeeb-types/src/format.rs format_si) plus web src/lib/format.ts, admin src/lib/format.ts and admin src/lib/infra.ts formatBytes (explicit decimals), measured in the consolidation map §4.2 case 11",
  "cases": [
